                  "value": "<p>An empirical basis for the Sire model: simulation of international relations for Europe. Statistics of 78 countries for each year during the period of 1948-1983: consumer price index, exchange rate of national currency to US dollar, total exports and imports, government revenues and expenditures, capital formation, defence expenditures, GNP, population and total military personnel.</p>"
